  - **Queries**: Remote case_embeddings collection
  - **Data access**: Vector search, metadata filtering

✅ /api/case-details - Case information retrieval
✅ /api/export - Data export functionality  
✅ /api/error-reports - Error reporting
✅ /api/health - Health check endpoint

Frontend Pages
✅ /dashboard, /patient/[id], /new-case, /analysis
  - **Dashboard**: Lists patients, uses /api/patients
  - **Patient Detail**: Shows individual patient, uses /api/patients/[id]
  - **New Case**: Creates patients, submits to /api/patients
  - **Analysis**: AI analysis results, updates via /api/patients/[id] PATCH

✅ State management logic that pulls from MongoDB (like Context Providers)
  - **AppStateContext**: Stores analysis results in sessionStorage, not MongoDB
  - **No direct MongoDB queries from frontend** - all via API routes
  - **Local state only** - React state + sessionStorage for UI persistence

Electron-Specific Files
✅ electron/ipc/handlers.ts
  - **Operations**: CRUD operations via IPC handlers
  - **Handlers**: db:getInfo, db:exportData, db:getStorageSettings
  - **Database queries**: listCollections(), countDocuments(), find()
  - **Data access**: Full collection enumeration, document export

✅ electron/db/local-db.ts & electron/local-database.js
