O: [objective content here]

A: [assessment content here]

P: [plan content here]

IMPORTANT: Use EXACTLY "S: ", "O: ", "A: ", "P: " at the start of lines. No extra characters or formatting.

OUTPUT JSON:
{
  "enhancedSoapNotes": "formatted SOAP notes string",
